<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS TUMBLES TO Q4 LOSS.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS TUMBLES TO Q4 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Qtr 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>  Net loss from normal ops		     81 vs 1.02 bln profit</p>
<p>  Net/shr from normal ops (gldrs)   loss 0.24 vs 2.99 profit</p>
<p>  Net loss					  949 vs 652 profit</p>
<p>  Total net/shr (guilders)	    loss 2.78 vs 1.91 profit</p>
<p>  Net sales (billions)			21.41 vs 19.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts expected Philips Electronics NV to report</p>
<p>fourth quarter net profit from normal operations of 387-750</p>
<p>million guilders, with consensus around 526 million.</p>
<p> Income from operations		profit 288 vs 1.26 bln profit</p>
<p> Income before taxes		   profit  74 vs 1.17 bln profit</p>
<p> Income after taxes		    profit  13 vs 1.14 bln profit</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
